## HorneroOS modifications

- The initial extraction was sourced from
  [ulises-jeremias/dotfiles](https://github.com/ulises-jeremias/dotfiles)
  at commit `b26db04`; the shell runtime and its layout presets now live in
  this repository.
- Personal-workstation assumptions removed: chezmoi-managed paths replaced
  with XDG/env-based resolution (`utils/Paths.qml`), `HorneroConfig`
  branding repointed to HorneroOS/Hornero Shell, dotfiles provenance URLs
  repointed to HorneroOS homes. See `docs/PROVENANCE.md`.
- The runtime uses Hornero-owned `horneroctl` contracts for operating-system
  operations. Platform utilities remain external dependencies and are not
  vendored code.
- Per the GPL-3.0 terms of the original work, all HorneroOS modifications to
  the shell runtime (`shell.qml`, `modules/`, `services/`, `config/`,
  `utils/`, `components/`, `assets/`, `plugin/`, `extras/`, `presets/`)
  are likewise licensed under GPL-3.0-only.

